B.aYp=s(["That is a question for a qualified scholar, and I am not one. I can stay with how this feels while you find one.","I cannot give a ruling on your own situation. A scholar you trust can, and the support here is yours either way.","A verdict is not mine to give. A scholar who knows you can answer it properly, and I am still here."],t.s)
