B.aor=new A.cR("Fear Allah wherever you are, follow a bad deed with a good one and it will erase it, and treat people with good character.","Abu Dharr & Mu\u2019adh (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1987","hasan","Darussalam")
B.aol=new A.cR("Allah does not look at your appearances or your wealth, but He looks at your hearts and your deeds.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564",null,null)
B.aoE=new A.cR("Leave that which makes you doubt for that which does not make you doubt.","al-Hasan ibn Ali (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2518","sahih","Darussalam")
B.aob=new A.cR("The strong believer is better and more beloved to Allah than the weak believer, and there is good in each.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2664 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aof=new A.cR("Do not hate one another, do not envy one another, do not turn away from one another \u2014 and be, O servants of Allah, brothers.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6065 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
