B.b56=s(["I am here. Is everyone awake and breathing normally right now? If someone is hard to wake, breathing slowly, or having a seizure, call your local emergency number now and stay with them.","Thank you for staying. Before anything else: is anyone in danger at this moment? If you are not sure, call your local emergency number, and I will stay right here.","I do not want to guess what that means, so I will ask plainly: is the person safe and awake, and is someone with them? One word is enough."],t.s)
