B.b6_=s(["Hadi: The dice decide the roll; you decide the move.","Hadi: I protect my stars. Do you protect yours?","Hadi: One careful step beats three hurried ones.","Hadi: A pawn on a star square cannot be captured. Remember where they are.","Hadi: Two pawns on one square stand together. Keep a friend beside a lone pawn.","Hadi: Look behind you before you step ahead: who could land on your pawn?","Hadi: Moving the pawn that is nearest home is not always the best move.","Hadi: Every roll is a small question. Take a breath before you answer it."],t.s)
