B.b_Z=s(["what breaks the fast","what breaks fast","what invalidates the fast","what invalidates fasting","what nullifies the fast","what ruins the fast","does brushing teeth break the fast","does an injection break the fast","does swallowing saliva break the fast","does vomiting break the fast","does medicine break the fast","does a blood test break the fast","break my fast","invalidate my fast"],t.s)
B.clL=new A.a0(B.b_Z,"The Qur'an draws the limits of the fast: \"And eat and drink until the white thread of dawn becomes distinct to you from the black thread [of night]. Then complete the fast until the sunset.\" (Qur'an 2:187). So eating, drinking and marital relations by day are what the fast guards against. Finer cases - brushing teeth, injections, medicine, a blood test, swallowing saliva, vomiting - are matters where scholars give detailed rulings, and I will not guess at them: please ask a qualified scholar.")
B.b7P=s(["eating by mistake","eat by mistake","ate by mistake","forgot i was fasting","forgot and ate","ate forgetfully","drank forgetfully","ate or drank while forgetting","eating forgetfully","forgetful eating"],t.s)
B.cnF=new A.a0(B.b7P,"One who eats or drinks forgetfully while fasting is told to complete the fast: this is reported from the Prophet \ufdfa in Sahih al-Bukhari 1933. For a case that is yours, with its details, ask a qualified scholar.")
B.ba3=s(["who is exempt from fasting","exempt from fasting","excused from fasting","who does not have to fast","can a traveller skip fasting","can a traveler skip fasting","travelling and fasting","traveller fasting","sick and fasting","ill and fasting","skip fasting"],t.s)
B.cnY=new A.a0(B.ba3,"The Qur'an gives ease: \"and whoever is ill or on a journey - then an equal number of other days.\" (Qur'an 2:185), and for those who can fast only with hardship, a ransom of feeding a poor person each day (Qur'an 2:184). \"Allah intends for you ease and does not intend for you hardship\" (Qur'an 2:185). For particular cases - pregnancy, long illness, old age - please ask a qualified scholar.")
B.b3F=s(["friday prayer obligatory","is friday prayer obligatory","is jumuah obligatory","jumuah obligatory","jummah obligatory","jumuah fard","who must attend friday prayer","missing jumuah","missing friday prayer"],t.s)
B.cpd=new A.a0(B.b3F,"The Qur'an calls the believers on Friday: \"then proceed to the remembrance of Allah and leave trade.\" (Qur'an 62:9). A report in Sunan Abi Dawud 1067 (sahih per al-Albani) states that the Friday prayer in congregation is a duty on every Muslim, and it names those it excuses: the woman, the boy, the sick (and the slave). Whether a traveller or others are excused, ask a qualified scholar.")
B.boB=s(["ashura","fast of ashura","day of ashura","fasting ashura","arafah fast","fasting arafah","fast of arafah","day of arafah fast","fasting on arafah"],t.s)
B.clh=new A.a0(B.boB,"On fasting the Day of Arafah, the Prophet \ufdfa said that it expiates the previous year and the coming year, and that fasting Ashura (the 10th of Muharram) expiates the previous year (Sahih Muslim 1162). Late in his life he said that if he lived to the next year he would also fast the ninth (Sahih Muslim 1134). Ashura was fasted in his time too (Sahih al-Bukhari 2004).")
B.b5N=s(["monday thursday fast","fast mondays","fast thursdays","mondays and thursdays","fasting on monday and thursday","sunnah fasts","sunnah fast","voluntary fast","voluntary fasts","nafl fast","recommended fasts"],t.s)
B.clt=new A.a0(B.b5N,"Aisha reported that the Prophet \ufdfa used to fast on Mondays and Thursdays (Jami' at-Tirmidhi 745, sahih per Darussalam). He \ufdfa said that deeds are presented on those days and that he loved his deeds to be presented while he was fasting (Jami' at-Tirmidhi 747, hasan per Darussalam). Also: Arafah and Ashura (Sahih Muslim 1162).")
B.aS0=s(["zakat al fitr","zakat ul fitr","zakat al-fitr","fitrana","fitrah charity","sadaqat al fitr","eid charity","charity of eid","fitr charity"],t.s)
B.ckk=new A.a0(B.aS0,"Zakat al-Fitr is the charity given at the end of Ramadan. Ibn Umar reported that the Prophet \ufdfa prescribed one sa' (a measure of food) and ordered that it be given before people go out to the Eid prayer (Sahih al-Bukhari 1503). How much that is today, and in what form, please ask a qualified scholar.")
B.b0h=s(["who can receive zakat","who is eligible for zakat","who is eligible to receive zakat","zakat recipients","eight categories of zakat","eight categories zakat","zakat beneficiaries","who deserves zakat","give zakat to"],t.s)
B.clk=new A.a0(B.b0h,"The Qur'an names who zakat is for: \"Zakah expenditures are only for the poor and for the needy and for those employed to collect [zakah] and for bringing hearts together [for Islam] and for freeing captives [or slaves] and for those in debt and for the cause of Allah and for the [stranded] traveler - an obligation [imposed] by Allah.\" (Qur'an 9:60). Whether a particular person qualifies, ask a qualified scholar.")
