B.alY=new A.aN("app-free-cost",B.b2C,B.aXb,'Yes, it is free today. This is what the Settings screen says, under "What is free": "Everything in this app is free today, including H\u0101di, and nothing asks for a card. A paid plan for extra live answers is planned but not open yet. Connecting your own AI account is optional and advanced: it is under the More options menu (top right) on the H\u0101di screen."\n\nSo the prayer times, the Qur\'an, the lessons, the games, the stories and I are all free to use now, with no account needed. There are no points, coins or ranks anywhere in the app, and the Privacy policy says: "We do not sell personal data or show advertising based on it."\n\nWhat I cannot tell you is what will be paid for in future, or its price: I have no price list, and I will not guess. The Terms and Privacy screens in Settings are the place to read the exact words, and they are marked as drafts.\n[GO:/settings]',"privacy",!0,"")
B.b9v=s(["\\b(?:does|is|do|are) (?:this |the |your )?(?:app|ar rayaan|arrayaan|hadi|you|it) (?:track|tracking|tracks|spy|spying|spies|watch|watching|watches|monitor|monitoring|monitors|record|recording|records|collect|collecting|collects|sell|selling|sells|listen|listening|listens|log|logging|logs|store|stores|storing|share|shares|sharing)\\b.*\\b(?:me|my|us|our|data|location|chats?|conversations?|information|activity|usage)\\b","\\bam i being (?:tracked|watched|monitored|recorded|spied on)\\b","\\bwhat (?:data|information) (?:does|do) (?:this |the )?(?:app|hadi|you) (?:collect|store|keep|save|have|take|gather|log|share)\\b","\\bis (?:this |the )?app (?:spyware|spying on me|watching me)\\b","\\b(?:any |is there |are there )(?:tracking|trackers|spyware|analytics|telemetry)\\b","\\bdoes (?:this |the )?app (?:have|use|contain|include) (?:tracking|trackers|analytics|telemetry)\\b"],t.s)
