B.an6=new A.aN("qibla-direction",B.b_r,B.aGz,"The qibla is the direction of the Kaaba in Makkah, which every Muslim faces in prayer. Allah says: \"turn your face toward al-Masjid al-Haram. And wherever you [believers] are, turn your faces toward it [in prayer]\" (Qur'an 2:144).\n\nIf you can see the Kaaba, face it itself. If you are far away, facing its direction is enough: you do not need perfect accuracy. If you cannot work out the direction, do your best with a compass, an app or by asking, and your prayer stands even if you were slightly off.\n\nIn the app, the Qibla screen works out the exact bearing from your location. It needs your location (asked only when you tap the button) or the city you choose in Prayer Times. The direction is worked out on your device. The live compass uses your phone's magnetic sensor, so keep away from metal and magnets; it may show a static dial on a desktop computer.\n\nOn a journey, the Prophet \ufdfa prayed his voluntary prayers on the back of his mount facing whichever way it went, but never the obligatory prayer (Sahih al-Bukhari 1098).\n\nSource: Qur'an 2:144; Sahih al-Bukhari 1098.\n[GO:/qibla]","qibla",!0,"")
B.aOY=s(["\\b(?:five|5) (?:daily )?prayers?\\b","\\bdaily prayers?\\b","\\bnames? of (?:the )?(?:five )?(?:daily )?prayers?\\b","\\bprayer times? (?:in islam|are|of)\\b","\\bwhen (?:is|does|do|should|can) (?:i |we )?(?:pray )?(?:the )?(?:fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)\\b","\\btime (?:of|for) (?:the )?(?:fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)\\b","\\b(?:fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha) (?:time|ends?|starts?|begins?)\\b","\\bwhen does (?:fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)\\b","\\bwhat are the prayers\\b","\\bwhen to pray\\b","\\bhow many (?:times|prayers) (?:a|per|in a|each|every) day\\b","\\btimes? of prayers? (?:per|in a|each|every) day\\b","\\bprayers? times? (?:per|in a|each|every) day\\b","\\bhow often do muslims pray\\b","\\bwhat is the (?:last|first) time for\\b","\\bwhen does.*prayer (?:start|end|begin)\\b"],t.s)
