B.akT=new A.aN("wudu-howto",B.blu,B.bdd,"Wudu is the washing you do before prayer. Allah says: \"wash your faces and your forearms to the elbows and wipe over your heads and wash your feet to the ankles\" (Qur'an 5:6). The Prophet \ufdfa taught it by doing it, as 'Uthman showed it (Sahih al-Bukhari 159).\n\nThe steps:\n1. Make the intention in your heart and say \"Bismillah\".\n2. Wash both hands up to the wrists, three times.\n3. Rinse your mouth three times.\n4. Sniff water into your nose and blow it out, three times.\n5. Wash your face three times, from the hairline to the chin and ear to ear.\n6. Wash your right arm to the elbow, then your left, three times each.\n7. Wipe your head once with wet hands, from the front back to the nape and forward again; wipe the ears too.\n8. Wash your right foot to the ankle, then your left, three times each, between the toes as well.\n9. Say the shahadah and, if you like, the du'a after wudu.\n\nThe only obligatory parts are the face, the arms, the head and the feet. The rest are sunnah, but do them all if you can. Do not waste water. The Wudu guide in this app shows it step by step.\n\nSource: Qur'an 5:6; Sahih al-Bukhari 159.\n[GO:/huda/guide?id=huda-wudu]","wudu",!0,"")
B.b9S=s(["\\b(?:break|breaks|breaking|broke|broken|invalidat\\w*|nullif\\w*|cancel\\w*|void\\w*|undo\\w*|end|ends|ruin\\w*)\\b.*\\bwudu\\b","\\bwudu\\b.*\\b(?:break|breaks|breaking|broke|broken|invalidat\\w*|nullif\\w*|cancel\\w*|void\\w*|again|valid|remain|still|stay|stays|last|lasts|renew)\\b","\\bdo i (?:need|have) to (?:redo|repeat|renew|make) wudu\\b","\\bneed (?:to )?(?:make|do|renew|redo) wudu (?:again|after)\\b","\\bwhat (?:cancels?|breaks?|invalidates?) (?:my |the )?(?:wudu|ablution)\\b","\\bis my wudu (?:valid|broken|still)\\b","\\b(?:sleep|sleeping|asleep|nap|dozed|dozing|fell asleep|drowsy)\\b.*\\bwudu\\b","\\bwudu\\b.*\\b(?:sleep|sleeping|asleep|nap|dozed|touch\\w*|blood|bleed\\w*|vomit\\w*|laugh\\w*|camel|private part|wind|gas|fart\\w*|doubt\\w*|unsure|not sure)\\b","\\btouch(?:ing)? (?:my |a |the )?(?:private part|genital|penis|woman|wife|husband|spouse)\\b.*\\b(?:wudu|prayer)\\b","\\b(?:wudu|ablution)\\b.*\\b(?:touch\\w*)\\b"],t.s)
