B.ami=new A.aN("language-help",B.aTX,B.b59,'You change the language on the Language & Voice screen: open the menu and choose "Language & Voice" (or Settings, then the language row). The app offers English, Urdu, Arabic, Indonesian, French, Turkish, Bangla and Malay, but not all of them are translated yet, and the screen says so for each one:\n- Arabic, Bangla and Urdu: the menu and tab names, the titles on the Home screen, the first questions you see when you open the app, and the top of Settings are translated. These are first drafts waiting for a native speaker to check them. Arabic and Urdu also turn the layout right-to-left.\n- Indonesian: only the Language & Voice labels are translated.\n- French, Turkish and Malay: not translated yet; the app stays in English.\n\nLessons, stories, hadith, my answers, the prayer screens and every long text are still in English, with the original Arabic for scripture. I answer in English only. Natural human-sounding voices are not available yet: until they are, the device reads the words in its own voice.\n[GO:/settings/language]',"language",!0,"")
B.b2R=s(["\\bdownloads?\\b","\\bdownload(?:ing)? (?:the )?(?:quran|recitation|audio|surah|reciter|ayah|app|nasheed|content|duas?|lessons?)\\b","\\boffline\\b","\\bwithout (?:the )?(?:internet|wifi|wi fi|data|network)\\b","\\bno (?:internet|wifi|wi fi|network|connection|signal)\\b","\\b(?:work|works|working|use|using) (?:the )?(?:app )?(?:offline|without internet)\\b","\\bsave (?:the )?(?:recitation|audio|surah|quran)\\b","\\bstorage\\b","\\bdata usage\\b","\\bmobile data\\b","\\bhow much space\\b","\\bdelete (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b","\\bremove (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b"],t.s)
