B.bgJ=s(["I am glad you are here. A parent or teacher is the best person to ask about this. Wasia in the Academy is there for your learning, and the lines below are free if you ever need to talk.","That is a good thing to ask someone you trust, like a parent or your teacher at the masjid. If you feel unsafe or upset, tell a trusted adult today (you choose who). The lines below are for young people."],t.s)
