B.R1=s(["Roll the die. You need a six to bring a pawn out of its yard.","A six gives you another roll. There is no penalty for three sixes.","Move one pawn the number rolled. If any pawn can move, you must move.","Land on a lone opponent pawn to send it back to its yard. Capturing does not give an extra roll.","Safe squares (the four start squares and the gold stars) cannot be captured on. Two of your pawns on one square also protect each other.","To reach home a pawn needs the exact number. A bigger roll cannot move it.","First to bring all four pawns home wins. Two to four players; computer players fill empty seats. No stakes of any kind."],t.s)
B.R2=s(["\u0c1c\u0c28","\u0c2b\u0c3f\u0c2c\u0c4d\u0c30","\u0c2e\u0c3e\u0c30\u0c4d\u0c1a\u0c3f","\u0c0f\u0c2a\u0c4d\u0c30\u0c3f","\u0c2e\u0c47","\u0c1c\u0c42\u0c28\u0c4d","\u0c1c\u0c41\u0c32\u0c48","\u0c06\u0c17","\u0c38\u0c46\u0c2a\u0c4d\u0c1f\u0c46\u0c02","\u0c05\u0c15\u0c4d\u0c1f\u0c4b","\u0c28\u0c35\u0c02","\u0c21\u0c3f\u0c38\u0c46\u0c02"],t.s)
B.bjq=s(["If something is making you sad or scared, or someone is hurting you, the best thing is to tell a grown-up you trust: a parent, a teacher, an aunt or uncle. You can tell them more than once, until someone listens.","If you do not know who to tell, press \u201cNeed to talk to someone?\u201d on the Kids Corner page. It shows people you can call or text who help children.","Nothing in this app is a secret from the grown-ups who keep you safe. If someone asks you to keep a secret that makes you feel bad, you do not have to."],t.s)
