B.aLD=s(["Hadi: Pawns cannot step backwards. Each pawn move changes the board for good.","Hadi: A pawn in the centre gives your other pieces room to move."],t.s)
B.b2A=s(["Hadi: A knight reaches more squares from the centre than from the edge.","Hadi: The knight is the only piece that jumps. Look for the squares it forks."],t.s)
B.aTq=s(["Hadi: A bishop on an open diagonal sees across the board. Check what it points at.","Hadi: A bishop stays on one colour of square all game."],t.s)
B.baj=s(["Hadi: Rooks like open files, with no pawns in the way.","Hadi: Two rooks that guard each other are stronger than two apart."],t.s)
B.b1x=s(["Hadi: The queen is strong, but a queen that is chased loses time. Bring her out with a purpose.","Hadi: Do not trade your queen for less than her worth."],t.s)
B.bj0=s(["Hadi: A king that walks forward early is exposed. Keep him sheltered.","Hadi: In the endgame the king becomes a fighting piece; before it, he hides."],t.s)
B.brL=new A.T(B.bA2,[B.aLD,B.b2A,B.aTq,B.baj,B.b1x,B.bj0],t.VJ)
