B.b2q=s(["Thank you for telling me. That took honesty, and I am not going to lecture you. It sounds like this is weighing on you. What would you like to be different?","I am glad you said it out loud. A hard night does not wipe out the effort you have put in. Would you like to tell me what happened, or work out one small step for the next hour?","I am still here, and you do not have to have it worked out. Is there one person you trust, or a doctor, who could know about this?"],t.s)
B.aGr=s(["Thank you for trusting me with that. You are not in trouble here, and I am not going to lecture you. What is the hardest part of it right now?","I hear you. Wanting things to be different is a real step, even on a bad day. Would you like to talk about what is happening tonight, or about who could be beside you?","I am staying with you in this conversation. You do not have to decide everything now. Is there someone who could be with you, or a doctor you could call?"],t.s)
B.aSG=s(["Thank you for saying it. Money and shame can pile up together, and carrying that alone is heavy. Do you feel safe right now, with the money and with yourself?","That sounds painful, and it is not the end of the road. You do not have to solve the debt tonight. What feels most urgent to you right now?","I am here, and I am not here to judge. One thing that helps many people is telling one safe person. Is there someone you could tell?"],t.s)
B.aNz=s(["Thank you for telling me. A lot of people carry this quietly, and carrying it does not make you a bad person. What would you like to be different?","I hear you, and there is no need to go into detail with me. The urge tends to rise and then pass. Would it help to talk about what usually comes just before?","I am here, and I am not shocked. Many people find it easier once one trusted person or a counsellor knows. Is there someone like that for you?"],t.s)
B.aKl=s(["Wanting to quit is a good thing to bring here, and the fact that it is hard does not mean you are weak. What has helped you most in the past, even a little?","Thank you for telling me. Many people try several times before it sticks, and each try teaches something. What is the hardest time of day for you?","I am here. A doctor or a pharmacist can talk through ways of quitting that fit your life. Would you like to think about what to ask them?"],t.s)
B.aRy=s(["Thank you for telling me. I am not going to lecture you. What happened, or what would help most right now?","I hear you. Coming back after a slip is something that takes courage. What would you like to be different?","I am still here. You do not have to explain everything. Is there someone you trust who could be with you tonight?"],t.s)
B.b7z=s(["It is exhausting to love someone who is struggling, and your own tiredness counts too. What does a hard day look like for you?","Thank you for telling me. You did not cause this and you cannot fix it for them, but you can look after yourself. What do you need most at the moment?","I hear how much you care. Families often need support of their own, apart from the person who is struggling. Is there someone you can talk to?"],t.s)
